# Citation metadata for the molledger software release.
#
# The archived version is the GitHub release tagged v1.0.1 in this repository;
# cite that tag rather than the moving default branch.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the manuscript and the archived release."
title: "molledger: a configuration-driven and replayable workflow for molecular property modelling"
abstract: >-
  Open-source workflow for the manuscript "molledger: a
  configuration-driven and replayable workflow for molecular property modelling":
  schema-validated configuration and command-line workflow, training-partition
  feature evidence scorecard, evidence-guided descriptor recommender, modular
  prior/residual predictor, benchmark runners, archived per-split results, and the
  statistics scripts that regenerate every paired comparison reported in the manuscript.
type: software
version: "1.0.1"
date-released: "2026-10-19"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/FanchonSora/MolLedger"
url: "https://github.com/FanchonSora/MolLedger"
keywords:
  - cheminformatics
  - molecular property prediction
  - D-MPNN
  - feature selection
  - reproducible benchmark
authors:
